blavaan 0.3-12 is now on CRAN. It fixes a number of bugs, with some new functionality for the wiggle.sd <http://wiggle.sd> argument and for sampling from the prior. The default priors have also been tweaked for improved sampling efficiency. Further input about default priors is welcome.

